nicate their concerns and needs to their manager in a professional manner, using language from the company's policies. The user can say something like, \"I'm having trouble sleeping due to early morning meetings. Would it be possible to schedule our meeting at a more standard time, such as 10:00 AM or later?\"\n\n---\n**Sources:**\n1. Nexarion State Policy Addendum \u2014 2.1 New York Paid Sick Leave\n2. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 5.1 Standard Business Hours\n3. Nexarion Remote Work Technology Supplement \u2014 4.1 Availability and Response Time Standards\n4. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 Section 11: Harassment, Discrimination & Retaliation\n5. Nexarion Remote Work Technology Supplement \u2014 4.2 Time Tracking for Non-Exempt Remote Employees", "grounding_score": 0.7, "compliance_passed": true}
