hip Withdrawal Provisions\n3. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 1.3 HSA Details - NexCare Basic Enrollees\n4. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 6.1 Pay Schedule", "grounding_score": 0.7, "compliance_passed": false}
