, depending on the plan you choose and your dog's age and health. Make sure to review the available plans to select one that best fits your needs.\n\n---\n**Sources:**\n1. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 7.1 Health, Dental & Vision Insurance\n2. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 7.3 COBRA Continuation Coverage - Rate Schedule\n3. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 4.2 Voluntary Supplemental Life Insurance\n4. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 7.3 Life & Disability Insurance\n5. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 Section 7: Employee Benefits\n6. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 2025 Benefits Guide  |  Confidential\n7. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 4.1 Company-Provided Coverage Summary", "grounding_score": 0.7, "compliance_passed": true}
{"entry_id": "3a5f8450-23f5-4b98-a2b8-1a8d05e96459", "session_id": "16c1a7fa-298b-45f3-a71a-b8e944d3c5d3", "user_id": "1263dbbc-b5af-42d2-af49-ba20324deffe", "timestamp": "2026-04-28T19:38:31.997024", "query": "I'm enrolled in the NexCare Plus plan and I have $800 left in my Healthcare FSA at year end. How much of that can I roll over into next year, and where did I get that number?", "route": "hr_in_scope", "escalated": false, "situation_facts": "", "chunks_used": [{"document_name": "Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide", "section_header": "1.4 FSA Details - NexCare Plus and Premier Enrollees", "chunk_index": 7}, {"document_name": "Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide", "section_header": "1.4 FSA Details - NexCare Plus and Premier Enrollees", "chunk_index": 8}, {"document_name": "Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1)", "section_header": "NEXARION SOLUTIONS, INC.", "chunk_index": 60}, {"document_name": "Nexarion State Policy Addendum", "section_header": "1.1 PTO Accrual & Carryover - California Override", "chunk_index": 5}, {"document_name": "Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide", "section_header": "1.3 HSA Details - NexCare Basic Enrollees", "chunk_index": 6}], "final_answer": "You can roll over $660 of your $800 remaining in your Healthcare FSA into the next year. The remaining $140 will be forfeited after the grace period, which ends on March 15 of the following year. This rollover limit is based on the updated IRS guidelines as stated in the Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide. Make sure to use the rolled-over funds before the grace period ends to avoid losing any amount.\n\n---\n**Sources:**\n1. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 1.4 FSA Details - NexCare Plus and Premier Enrollees\n2. Nexarion Solutions Employee Handbook (1) \u2014 NEXARION SOLUTIONS, INC.\n3. Nexarion State Policy Addendum \u2014 1.1 PTO Accrual & Carryover - California Override\n4. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 1.3 HSA Details - NexCare Basic Enrollees", "grounding_score": 1.0, "compliance_passed": true}
