age - Rate Schedule\n4. Nexarion 2025 Benefits Guide \u2014 1.5 Dependent Care FSA\n5. Nexarion State Policy Addendum \u2014 1.3 California Family Rights Act (CFRA) vs. FMLA", "grounding_score": 0.7, "compliance_passed": true}
